Mazur's Thm 4 give a NONTRIVIAL Eisenstein quotient — below that the
quotient can vanish and `f` carries nothing. `q ≠ 2` is the formal
immersion (in characteristic `2` the `a₁ ≠ 0` argument fails). `q ≠ N`
