made `AtkinLehnerMorphism` an EMPTY type in its old base-free form; the
repair gives every field of `AtkinLehnerMorphism` the `ℚ`-structure of
its base, so `dual` now reads
`∀ {T}, (T ⟶ SpecQ) → Gamma0Datum N T → Gamma0Datum N T`.  There is no
