**THE RELEASE-17 REGRESSION AND ITS REPAIR (opened 2026-07-29, CLOSED
2026-07-30).**  This node was re-opened as a bare `sorry` at the
release-17 merge because its proof consumed the Atkin–Lehner moduli action
over a base where that action does not exist, and the merge note correctly
refused to patch it by threading an extra argument.  The record, kept
because the reasoning is what the re-cut is made of:

`flt-lean-218` REFUTED `exists_isNIsogenyPair` over a base of residue
characteristic `p ∣ N` (witness: `K = 𝔽̄_p`, `N = p`, `E/K` ordinary,
