The proof that stood here built `wY` by applying
`d.model.coarse.universal` to the natural transformation
`fun g dd => classify g (al.dual dd)` with `g : T ⟶ SpecLoc R`, i.e. it
invoked the moduli action over `ℤ_(q)`-SCHEMES.  There is no
