cusps are rational: a cusp of `X_0(N)` of denominator `d` is defined
over `ℚ(ζ_{gcd(d, N/d)})`, and for `N = 32` the values of
`gcd(d, 32/d)` over `d ∣ 32` are `1, 2, 4, 4, 2, 1`, so only the four
