/-- **No rational cyclic `81`-isogeny on the CM `j`-line `j = −12288000`**
(PROVEN 2026-07-26 over the already-present `X_0(3)` machinery — the
residue of `not_cyclicIsogeny_eightyOne` after the degree-`3` degeneracy
