**This is the whole of level `81`, and it is strictly shallower than the
statement it serves**: instead of the rational points of the genus-`4`
curve `X_0(81)` (`μ = 108`, `ν₂ = ν₃ = 0`, `12` cusps, `g = 1 + 9 − 6 = 4`)
