`finrank_cuspForm_of_x0HeckeCharpolyTable` (`ModularCurve/X0.lean`),
`cuspForm_eq_zero_level_thirteen` (ditto) and
`X0GenusOne.finrank_cuspForm_eq_one_of_x0Genus_eq_one` (this file) all need.

Its own docstring recorded the cheaper route and the arithmetic that decides
where the route reaches, and both are now taken literally.  The norm of
`f ∈ S₂(Γ₀(M))` over `SL(2, ℤ)` is a LEVEL-ONE form of weight
