    p     genus   index   rank J_0(p)(ℚ)   #non-cuspidal   regime
    11      1       12          0                3         genus 1
    17      1       18          0                2         genus 1
    19      1       20          0                1         genus 1
    37      2       38          1                2         Mazur–Vélu
    43      3       44          1                1         CM, h(−p) = 1
    67      5       68          2                1         CM, h(−p) = 1
    163    13      164          6                1         CM, h(−p) = 1

