removes.  Two instance-shaped facts about one explicit scheme are what remains.

**NO LONGER A LEAF — PROVEN 2026-07-31 (flt-lean-105) over
`isFinite_fixedLocus_of_geomFixed` and `isReduced_fixedLocus_of_isAdditiveOn`
