`exists_weierstrassModel_geomFibreAddEquiv_of_gamma0Datum`, and that is a
mechanical addition, not a theorem;  (ii) the base change from `d₀` over
`Spec ℚ` to `d` over `Spec ℚ̄`, which is what `_bc` is for;  (iii) turning
