**NAMEABILITY — why five small lemmas are restated here rather than imported.**
`ModularCurve/EllipticScheme.lean` carries `ℚ`-shaped versions of all five
(`dense_compl_singleton_of_isOpen`, `range_hom_specRat_eq_singleton`,
`isDominant_of_range_eq_compl`, `isIso_of_isDominant_of_inverse`,
`hom_specRat_eq_of_range_eq`), and **none of them is nameable in this module**:
`X0.lean` imports `EllipticScheme` NON-publicly, on purpose, because a
