geometric point `g` of an elliptic curve `E/ℚ` has exact order `21` and is
stable under `Gal(ℚ̄/ℚ)`, then

  `j(E) ∈ {3375/2, −140625/8, −189613868625/128, −1159088625/2097152}`.

