polynomial `preΨ'ₙ` vanishes at `x = 0`. Oddness is what lets the
`ΨSq`-form of `MazurX1Plane.zsmul_eq_zero_iff` be read as a square, so
that `preΨ'ₙ(0)² = 0` yields `preΨ'ₙ(0) = 0`.

